From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Combray <combray@localhost>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 20:30:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] WebGL: implement WEBGL_debug_renderer_info

The Vercel security checkpoint's telemetry probe reads
getExtension('WEBGL_debug_renderer_info').UNMASKED_* unconditionally; without the
extension that dereference throws and the challenge reports a client-side
browser failure (badInfo 1.1, shown to the user as Code 11).

The extension is always supported (no underlying GL requirement) and unlocks
UNMASKED_VENDOR_WEBGL/UNMASKED_RENDERER_WEBGL, which getParameter resolves to
the real GL strings on the WebGL thread via a new GetParameterString command.

